{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ensure funding for SEND pupils to have a 1-1 teacher",
        "additional_details": "There are reports that some pupils with Special Educational Needs and Disabilities (SEND) may no longer have the one-to-one support they need in school. Children with SEND are individuals. They have different needs, different abilities and different challenges. Removing the support they rely on can have a huge impact on their education, confidence, independence.",
        "background": "Ensure funding for each SEND pupil to have a supporting teacher to help their difficulties during school time",
